# What the dev watcher must not watch — see the same file in `src-tauri/` for
# the reasoning. Same ignore, expressed from this root, because `tauri dev`
# reads one of the two depending on which directory it treats as the project.
#
# The vendored agent writes activity and update-lock files into its own install
# directory (`resources/mcode/.mcode-active/<pid>.json`), and every one of them
# reads as a source change: the app rebuilt itself in a loop while a session ran.

src-tauri/resources/mcode
